  "texto": "Maya never had a single bruise. Nobody ever heard him raise his voice. Not once. Not in three years. And still, by the end, she couldn't order dinner without checking his face first. This is the story of the politest abuser you'll ever hear about. Five moves. Every one of them looks harmless on its own. Together, they can take a whole person apart. Quietly. Over months. I'll show you all five. But move number four is the one almost nobody recognizes, even while it's happening to them. First, a quick note. Maya and Daniel aren't real people. They're a composite, built from patterns that therapists describe again and again.",
